  "steps": [
    "Boil the potatoes for 20–30 minutes until tender. Drain and let them steam dry for 5 minutes.",
    "Spread on a large tray and gently smash each one with the back of a spoon. Drizzle with olive oil and season with chilli salt, garlic powder and smoked paprika.",
    "Roast at 200 °C fan for about 1 hour until deeply golden and crisp, checking after 40 minutes and turning the tray if needed.",
    "Whipped feta: blend the feta, yogurt, olive oil, garlic, lemon zest and juice until smooth.",
    "Hot honey: warm the honey with the chilli salt over low heat for 1–2 minutes without boiling, then leave to infuse.",
    "Spread the whipped feta on a platter, pile the potatoes on top, drizzle with hot honey and finish with chives, lemon zest and a little more chilli salt."
  ]
